        "Each entry's freshness state, fired downgrade reasons, and effective claim, plus the promotion hold/proceed verdict.",
        "Holds promotion when a claim-bearing entry is narrowed below the posture it asserts, and renders the exact downgrade reason rather than a bare color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "consumer": "release_packet",
      "source_projection": "freshness_alignment_projection",
      "ingests": [
        "Each release packet's declared freshness state and effective claim, which must equal the ledger's recomputed values.",
        "Public claim objects and release packets stay aligned on freshness state so a packet cannot publish a fresher claim than the run supports."
      ]
    },
    {
      "consumer": "support_export",
      "source_projection": "redaction_safe_projection",
      "ingests": [
        "Freshness states, downgrade reasons, and bound ids only.",
        "Never raw run logs, raw machine labels, or raw provider payloads behind a run."
      ]
    },
    {
      "consumer": "docs_help",
      "source_projection": "claim_state_projection",
      "ingests": [
        "Effective claim and downgrade label per entry.",
        "A narrowed or quarantined entry shows its narrowed claim and the reason, not its ceiling."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "inspection": {
    "how_to_recompute": "For each entry, compare the current run's corpus revision, hardware class and profile, lab-image revision, threshold version, reset-pending axes, run-metadata completeness, and capture age against the bound baseline and the canonical current revisions; fire each downgrade reason whose condition holds; derive the freshness state by precedence missing over incomparable over stale over aging over current; and set the effective claim to the lowest-ranked of the published ceiling and each fired reason's narrows_to level.",
    "promotion_gate": "Promotion holds when any claim-bearing entry's effective claim is below the posture it asserts; the quarantined and methodology entries assert no claim and never hold promotion on their own.",
    "freshness_ladder": "current keeps the ceiling; aging narrows a head-to-head comparison to an Aureline-only claim; stale narrows to methodology-only; incomparable or missing quarantines.",
